return [
    'primeros-pasos' => ['title' => 'Getting started with GestiaHR', 'summary' => 'How to move around and where to find what you need.', 'body' => "GestiaHR brings together your organization's people data and the requests they make to Human Resources.\n\n- The sidebar groups the screens you can open according to your role and the modules your organization has.\n- The «Create» button in the top bar opens the most used forms.\n- The inbox collects what is waiting for your answer: approvals and tasks.\n- The help button opens this guide and the articles of the screen you are on.\n\nIf the help does not solve it, you can send a request to Human Resources from the portal."],
